# FCC-ee adaptation of LHCb Sim10 dkfiles/Lb_gammaLambda=trpol.dec.
# Source: https://gitlab.cern.ch/lhcb-datapkg/Gen/DecFiles/-/blob/Sim10/dkfiles/Lb_gammaLambda%3Dtrpol.dec
# LHCb event type 15102303, dated 2016-05-24. Its HELAMP parameters are
# copied below exactly; only the signal aliases are adapted to this Pythia8
# interface, and no LHCbAcceptance generator cut is imported.
#
# This is a HELAMP angular-model scenario, distinct from the local PHSP
# acceptance sample. The original LHCb metadata says PolarizedLambdab: yes;
# this file alone does not prove the FCC-ee production polarization is modeled.
# The forced 1.0 decay fractions are not physical branching fractions.

Alias Lambdab0_SIGNAL Lambda_b0
Alias aLambdab0_SIGNAL anti-Lambda_b0
ChargeConj Lambdab0_SIGNAL aLambdab0_SIGNAL

Alias Lambda0_TRPOL Lambda0
Alias aLambda0_TRPOL anti-Lambda0
ChargeConj Lambda0_TRPOL aLambda0_TRPOL

Decay Lambdab0_SIGNAL
  1.000 Lambda0_TRPOL gamma HELAMP 0. 0. 1. 0.;
Enddecay
CDecay aLambdab0_SIGNAL

Decay Lambda0_TRPOL
  1.000 p+ pi- HELAMP .906 0. .423 0.;
Enddecay
CDecay aLambda0_TRPOL

End
